---
const partner=Astro.url.pathname==='/partners/';
---
<aside class="partner-invitation" aria-label="Сотрудничество с Best of Interiors"><div><span class="partner-eyebrow">ДЛЯ КОМПАНИЙ И БРЕНДОВ</span><h2>Пусть о вас узнают <em>ваши клиенты.</em></h2><p>ПРОМО в рейтингах, расширенная карточка и совместные материалы. Выберите формат участия в проекте.</p></div><div class="partner-actions"><a href={partner?'#contact':'/partners/'}><span>Сотрудничество<small>Форматы размещения и тарифы</small></span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg></a><a class="telegram-link" href="https://t.me/knsemykin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Обсудить в Telegram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></aside>
<style>
.partner-actions{display:grid;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0}.partner-actions .telegram-link{background:transparent;color:#d8e5ff;border:1px solid #7d98c6;font-size:16px}.partner-actions .telegram-link:hover{background:#344563}@media(max-width:600px){.partner-actions{width:100%;min-width:0}}
.partner-invitation{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding:38px;margin-bottom:45px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#263751,#1d2330 65%,#352430);border:1px solid #53688d;border-radius:20px;grid-column:1/-1}.partner-eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#adc1ff}.partner-invitation h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,42px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:15px 0}.partner-invitation em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:#adc1ff}.partner-invitation p{max-width:680px;font-size:17px;color:#d0d6e0}.partner-actions>a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:25px;flex-shrink:0;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:14px;background:#a6bfff;color:#101726;font-size:18px;font-weight:650}.partner-actions>a:hover{background:#c8d7ff}.partner-invitation small{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:450;margin-top:6px}.partner-invitation svg{width:24px;height:24px}@media(max-width:1000px){.partner-invitation{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}@media(max-width:600px){.partner-invitation{padding:25px;gap:24px}.partner-actions>a{width:100%;font-size:16px;padding:18px}.partner-invitation p{font-size:16px}}
</style>
